meta {
  name: 02_PackageHierarchy
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: The package hierarchy can be walked from the group level down

    When the group list is fetched
    And a group is fetched by id
    And that group's areas are fetched
    And an area is fetched by id
    And that area's packages are fetched
    And the export endpoint returns the same hierarchy
    When an unknown group id is requested, the response is 404
    When an unknown area id is requested, the response is 404

  The hierarchy is group -> area -> package. The scenario is read only and
  needs no cleanup.
}
